  "description": "A wise watermaster keeps a reserve beyond the reach of everyday thirst. Build this one-cell cabinet under Misc after Arrakis Survival for forty steel and 800 work. Haulers fill it with up to thirty real water rations; it starts empty and needs no power.\n\nSealed water is unavailable to ordinary drinking. Release water returns up to five rations to a clear nearby cell and disables automatic refilling so haulers cannot immediately reverse your order. Enable refill again when supplies recover. A blocked release spends nothing. Native deconstruction returns the stored water. It does not produce or purify water.",
